    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10182" root="خذرف" body-key="x">
    
      Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَخَذْرَفَ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a garment, or piece of cloth,)
<i>became rent,</i> or <i>pierced with holes.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَخَذْرَفَتْهُ النَّوَى</span> [<i>The place which was the object
of a journey</i>] <i>caused him to go forth,</i> or <i>depart;</i>
(L, K, TA;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَخَذْرَمَتْهُ</span>. (TA.)

